# GovernanceRules: data product profile of the GovernanceRules accelerator. Enterprise referential of the standard data governance rules that every MDM project of the company must apply.
_package: GovernanceRules
_type: DataProductProfile
_name: GovernanceRules
label: Governance Rules
description: >-
  Enterprise referential of the data governance rules that every MDM project of the company must apply, with
  their policies, owners, cited regulations and standards, and where each rule applies (data domain, data
  classification, attribute type). Stewards author the rules and the governance owner approves them; AI design
  agents read the rules in force through the MCP server.


  AI agent instructions: classify each attribute with AttributeTypeCatalog, then call RuleChecklist once with
  the data domain, classifications and attribute types; cite each applied rule code. Details in the
  GovernanceRule description.
modelConfiguration:
  type: POSTGRESQL
